                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I know its free and for what it does it is fine, but for the amount of soft locks and glitches I ran into getting to the 2nd boss I got fed up with it and decided to cut it short. This is partial to how the game is designed and imo is more of a flaw than an actual game designed mechanic for difficulty. Honestly what would fix this is just a simple rewind feature. If there were ways to unlock yourself I wouldn't even suggest that but there really isn't you just have to restart the level outright. And this game will at some point even prevent progress if restarts exceed a certain amount.  \n\nSome of the glitches I ran into:\n- Not being able to pick up a key because apparently already had it but really didn't. \n- The game just outright restarting the level on its own (usually happened upon my own restart)\n- Being able to control the RCCreator bot and the main character at the same time.\n- Getting killed by Creator bots despite there being a block of space in between the character and the enemy. \n\n\nThe music in this is outstanding btw. Also I love the art. Both the 8 bit stuff and the actual inspired art. \nAlso I do recommend the other games by this dev they are really talented. \n\nI can see myself finishing this someday Its going to be more of one off thing of random playing.",
